来是警察都不说一声，真该直接宰了他们！白欣研却是乘着这一林飞看似愣神的机会，腾身又是一脚，蹬向林飞的胸膛！林飞几乎本能的就张开左手轻轻一拍，又挡住了白欣研的攻击。“白警官，你最好不要再耽误我的时间，我今晚已经够倒霉了”！林飞心里苦叹，他就想赚几个深夜出租车钱，不仅碰到劫匪，还碰到警察，还有个昏迷的女人等着他抢救！怎么这年头，开个代班出租都这么难！？“干这种勾当碰到我们警方，自然是你倒霉，怪不得一直找不到你们，原来伪装成开出租车的了！天网恢恢疏而不漏，我就知道早晚能逮住一个，我绝不会让你对她胡作非为，有能耐就赢过我！”白欣研虽然觉得对手很强，但她毫不畏惧，又是连着开始用出了特工的格斗术，拳脚霍然朝着林飞招呼！“啪啪啪……”连续的十几拳，七八脚，都被林飞用一只左手轻而易举地格挡住。白欣研拳打脚踢，愣是没法让林飞从原地挪动半步，不由越打越心惊！就算她在西伯利亚克格勃训练营的时候，也不曾遇见过这么厉害的人物，简直比那些教官还要变态！林飞则是有些不悦，这么下去得拖到什么时候，这女人的体力很好，打上半个一个钟头不成问题。“白警官，你再这么瞎捣乱，打扰我救人，我可就不是防守这么简单了”，林飞警告道。“流氓！畜生！贩毒的还谈救人！？有本事就来啊！你以为我会怕你？”白欣研不屑地道。林飞不禁有些着恼，这女人还真以为自己怕了她？看来不把这无理取闹的女警摆平是没法安生了！就在白欣研拼尽全力使出一招连环绞杀腿的刹那，林飞忽然从她面前消失！像是一道鬼魅，从她身后出现，林飞一个手刀轻巧地击中了白欣研后颈。“呃嗯……”白欣研轻吟了声，直接晕阙着软软倒下。林飞根本懒得多管这女警，匆匆赶回昏迷的女人身边，可刚一把手按回她的心口，就让林飞脸色一阵惨白！心跳……停止了！？“SHIT！”林飞气地连英文粗口都开始爆了。回头看了眼那昏迷的白欣研，林飞都恨不得上去给她两巴掌，都怪她碍事！扶着脑袋，林飞脑海里灵光电闪。思忖片刻，直接跑到了白欣研的那辆黑色轿车边，开启了车子后备箱。翻找了一下，果然看到有一根电瓶连接线在那儿。毕竟是当警察的，一般车子应急的设备还是有准备。林飞将捷达车开到了女人身边后，将电瓶连接上，然后扯出阴阳两头电极的线路。通常汽车电瓶的电压不足以致命，其实也达不到医院里抢救用电的电压，但林飞现在能做的就只有这么多。他深呼吸一口气，两手同时将电线触在了女人那娇嫩的胸口处！电一下！没效果！两下！三下……林飞足足电了五下，再去碰触那心口的时候，心脏终于跳动了起来！林飞长出一口气，露出一个“好险”的笑容，幸亏及时想到这办法，没想到还真起好效果了。但林飞知道抢救还没结束，他把电线拔掉后，继续吻住女人的小嘴，做着人工呼吸。只有等女人清醒过来，才能彻底安心。过了几分钟后，女人的呼吸越来越平顺起来。林飞并没注意，不知何时，女人的一对明眸，已经微微隙开，眼神也渐渐地清明……就当林飞打算最后再做几次人工呼吸的时候，嘴刚要亲到女人的唇瓣上，却忽然感到一阵风朝着自己的脸庞袭来！“啪！”林飞因为太过专注，都没注意，自己脸上已经被扇了一个耳光！只见女人已经清醒过来，睁大了一对水汪汪的大眼睛，却满是恨意与寒光，俏脸发白地盯着自己。林飞无辜地摸了摸脸，但见女人醒了还是颇为高兴的，憨笑道：“小姐，你醒了就醒了，干嘛打我？”“变态……禽兽……”女人咬着银牙，眼眶红红的，委屈的泪水簌簌滑落。她的口鼻间，满是男人那一股子烟草味，很显然，这个男人已经吻了她不知道多久。林飞郁闷地道：“你误会了，我是在救你，你刚才因为缺氧昏迷，我给你做人工呼吸，心脏按摩，还给你做了电击呢……”女人似乎这才发现，自己的胸前凉凉的，低头眼光一扫，才发现自己的私密部位，竟然曝露在空气里！心口的位置更还是发热，显然之前男人一直在摸那个地方……“你……你……你竟敢……”女人似乎气急攻心，直接两眼一翻，又晕了过去！林飞这下有点发傻了，赶紧一探她的脉搏，发现是受惊过度又身体疲劳，并无大碍，才算放心下来。看了看一旁的女警，林飞也觉得不宜多留，于是把女人的衣物整理了下，抱着她回到出租车上。也不急于叫醒女人，免得一阵争执，林飞还是先开着车离开了工地。……凌晨，位于市区望月大厦五星级酒店的豪华套房内。一名衣冠楚楚的男子身穿睡衣，站在落地窗前，眉头蹙着，一手拿着香槟，另一手接着电话。“还没找到阿忠和阿虎吗？”男子阴沉地问道。“马少，我们刚才通了交警的关系，调查了下那附近的录像，找到他们了！”电话里一人紧张地回答。“哦？那为什么到现在还没带着那女人来见我？”“他们被一个陌生女人追赶，那女人追赶的时候好像有拿出证件，可能是警察。后来他们坐上了一辆出租车，那女人也开车追赶，然后两辆车开到城北开发区附近，就因为没摄像头的关系不见了……”“怎么那里还有警察？那我要的女人呢！？”男子皱眉道。电话里的人怯怯地道：“苏总好像被成功抓到了，但……但也跟着不见了。”“给我去立刻查清楚那辆出租车是哪家的，我就不信一辆出租车能人间蒸发了！”男子狠厉地道。“是！”", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/nuzongcaideshenjibaobiao/4.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 0004 Why are you hitting me? \"Why, after following you for so long, you still don't know what I, Bai Xinyan, look like? Why are you pretending?\" Bai Xinyan sneered, as if he saw through Lin Fei's cover-up. Lin Fei's mouth twitched depressedly, that's all. Is she a policewoman? Could it be that today is an unlucky day on the lunar calendar when everything is unfavorable? It's all the fault of those two stupid robbers. Why didn't they say anything to the police when they came after them? They should have been killed directly! However, Bai Xinyan took advantage of this opportunity when Lin Fei seemed to be dazed, jumped up and kicked Lin Fei in the chest again! Lin Fei almost instinctively opened his left hand and patted it lightly, blocking Bai Xinyan's attack again. \"Officer Bai, you'd better not waste my time any more. I'm already unlucky enough tonight!\" Lin Fei sighed inwardly. He just wanted to earn some late-night taxi money. Not only did he encounter robbers, he also encountered the police, and there was an unconscious woman waiting for him to rescue! Why is it so difficult to open a rental agency these days? ? \"It's unlucky for you to come across our police while doing this kind of thing. No wonder I haven't been able to find you. You turned out to be driving a taxi! The sky net is very sparse, so I knew I would catch one sooner or later. I will never let you do anything wrong to her. If you can, beat me!\" Although Bai Xinyan felt that her opponent was very strong, she was not afraid. She started to use the fighting skills of an agent again, and suddenly greeted Lin Fei with her fists and kicks! \"Pah, pah, pah...\" A dozen consecutive punches and seven or eight kicks were all easily blocked by Lin Fei with his left hand. Bai Xinyan punched and kicked, but he couldn't make Lin Fei move even half a step from where he was. He couldn't help but become more and more frightened! Even when she was in the KGB training camp in Siberia, she had never met such a powerful person. He was even more perverted than those instructors! Lin Fei was a little displeased. How long could this go on? This woman's physical strength was very good, so it wouldn't be a problem to fight for half an hour. \"Officer Bai, if you continue to cause trouble like this and disturb me from rescuing people, I will no longer be as simple as defending,\" Lin Fei warned. \"Rogue! Bastard! Are drug dealers talking about rescuing people!? If you have the ability, just come! Do you think I will be afraid of you?\" Bai Xinyan said disdainfully. Lin Fei couldn't help but feel a little annoyed. Did this woman really think he was afraid of her? It seems that there is no way to live in peace unless this unreasonable female police officer is dealt with! Just when Bai Xinyan tried his best to use a series of strangulation moves, Lin Fei suddenly disappeared from in front of her! Like a ghost, Lin Fei appeared from behind her and lightly hit Bai Xinyan on the back of the neck with a knife. \"Uh huh...\" Bai Xinyan groaned softly, fainted and fell softly. Lin Fei didn't bother to care about the policewoman at all, and hurried back to the unconscious woman, but as soon as he pressed his hand back on her heart, Lin Fei's face turned pale! The heartbeat... stopped! ? \"SHIT!\" Lin Fei was so angry that he even began to use expletives in English. Looking back at the unconscious Bai Xinyan, Lin Fei wanted to go up and slap her twice, blaming her for being in the way! Holding his head, Lin Fei's mind flashed with lightning. After thinking for a moment, he ran directly to Bai Xinyan's black car and opened the trunk of the car. After rummaging around, I saw a battery cable there. After all, he is a police officer, so he usually has emergency equipment prepared in his car. After Lin Fei drove the Jetta to the woman's side, he connected the battery, and then pulled out the wires between the yin and yang electrodes. Normally, the voltage of a car battery is not fatal, and in fact it does not reach the voltage required for emergency use in hospitals, but there is only so much Lin Fei can do now. He took a deep breath and touched the wire to the woman's delicate chest with both hands at the same time! Power it up! No effect! Twice! Three times... Lin Fei was shocked five times. When he touched his heart again, his heart finally started beating! Lin Fei let out a long breath and showed a \"dangerous\" smile. Fortunately, he thought of this method in time, but he didn't expect that it actually had a good effect. But Lin Fei knew that the rescue was not over yet. After unplugging the wire, he continued to kiss the woman's mouth and perform artificial respiration. Only when the woman wakes up can she feel completely at ease. After a few minutes, the woman's breathing became smoother and smoother. Lin Fei didn't notice, but at some point, the woman's bright eyes opened slightly, and her eyes gradually became clearer... Just when Lin Fei was about to give a few more artificial respirations, and just about to kiss the woman's lips, he suddenly felt a gust of wind coming towards his face! \"Pah!\" Lin Fei was so focused that he didn't even notice that he had been slapped on the face! I saw that the woman had woken up, her big watery eyes were wide open, but they were full of hatred and cold light, and her pretty face was staring at him with a pale face. Lin Fei touched his face innocently, but he was quite happy to see the woman awake. He smiled naively and said, \"Miss, you woke up when you woke up. Why did you hit me?\" \"Abnormal...animal...\" The woman gritted her silver teeth, her eyes were red, and tears of grievance slipped down. Her mouth and nose were filled with the smell of tobacco from a man. It was obvious that this man had been kissing her for who knows how long. Lin Fei said depressedly: \"You misunderstood. I was saving you. You just passed out due to lack of oxygen. I gave you artificial respiration, heart massage, and gave you electric shocks...\" The woman seemed to realize that her chest was cold. She lowered her head and glanced around, only to find that her private parts were exposed to the air! The area around her heart was still hot. Apparently the man had been touching that place before... \"You... you... how dare you...\" The woman seemed so angry that she rolled her eyes and fainted again! Lin Fei was a little confused now. He quickly checked her pulse and found that she was overly frightened and tired. It was nothing serious, so he felt relieved. After looking at the policewoman on the side, Lin Fei also felt that it was not advisable to stay any longer, so he arranged the woman's clothes and carried her back to the taxi. I am not in a hurry to wake up the woman to avoid a dispute.", "title_en": "Chapter 4"}